      "releaseNotes": "• Color picker for highlighted low threshold values.\n• Low threshold line in graphs.\n• Icons display properly in all iOS 26 modes (Default, Dark, Clear and Tinted).\n• Optimizations of data pipeline (faster updating and more battery efficient).\n• Detailed connectivity info (at bottom of watch app).\n• Better coordination with multiple watch use.",
      "version": "1.2",
